{'symbol': 'CDNS', 'date': '2022-04-07 10:45:00', 'title': 'CADENCE SPECTRE FX FASTSPICE SIMULATOR IS ADOPTED BY SK HYNIX TO ACCELERATE DRAM DESIGN', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CADENCE TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SK HYNIX INC. HAS DEPLOYED THE SPECTRE FX SIMULATOR FOR FASTSPICE VERIFICATION OF THEIR DDR4 AND DDR5 DRAMS.'}